s icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Depths_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/7/7b/Stage_Depths_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073002\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dank_Depths\" title=\"Dank Depths\"><img alt=\"Stage Dank Depths icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Dank Depths icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Dank_Depths_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/04/Stage_Dank_Depths_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073222\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scarred_Womb\" title=\"Scarred Womb\"><img alt=\"Stage Scarred Womb icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Scarred Womb icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Scarred_Womb_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/af/Stage_Scarred_Womb_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073303\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chest_(Floor)\" title=\"Chest\"><img alt=\"Chest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Chest icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Chest_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/2/25/Stage_Chest_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825114034\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boss_Room\" title=\"Boss Room\"><img alt=\"Boss Room Icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Boss Room Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Boss_Room_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/30/Boss_Room_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821102031\" /></a></span><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-7\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Removed in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(except in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc nr indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_nr_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/04/Dlc_nr_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20241126195308\" /></span></span>  Chance to replace <a href=\"/wiki/Hopper\" title=\"Hopper\">Hoppers</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Trite\" title=\"Trite\">Trites</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"unlocked by\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Unlock Method</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Portal\" title=\"The gate is open!\"><img alt=\"The gate is open!\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Achievement The gate is open! icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Achievement_The_gate_is_open%21_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/9/98/Achievement_The_gate_is_open%21_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210822063058\" /></a></span> Defeat <a href=\"/wiki/The_Lamb\" title=\"The Lamb\">The Lamb</a></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div id=\"context-page\" class=\"context-box\"><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-12\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Afterbirth †\"><img alt=\"(in Afterbirth † and Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc a† indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_a%E2%80%A0_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/4/4c/Dlc_a%E2%80%A0_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20220204205709\" /></span></span> </div> \n<div style=\"padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 25px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Questionmarkisaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Questionmarkisaac.png\" data-image-key=\"Questionmarkisaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/1d/Questionmarkisaac.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825083347\" /></span></span> <i>For the boss with a similar name, see <a href=\"/wiki/Monstro\" title=\"Monstro\">Monstro</a>.&#32;For the item with a similar name, see <a href=\"/wiki/Lil_Monstro\" title=\"Lil Monstro\">Lil Monstro</a>.</i></div>\n<p><br />\n<b>Ministros</b> hop around the room aimlessly but will hop in the general direction of Isaac if he gets too close. They will occasionally pause to spit a disorganized cluster of projectiles akin to &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Monstro\" title=\"Monstro\"><img alt=\"Boss Monstro ingame\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Boss Monstro ingame.png\" data-image-key=\"Boss_Monstro_ingame.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/5/50/Boss_Monstro_ingame.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210822103512\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Monstro\" title=\"Monstro\">Monstro</a>. Ministros are unlocked by defeating &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Lamb\" title=\"The Lamb\"><img alt=\"Boss The Lamb ingame\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Boss The Lamb ingame.png\" data-image-key=\"Boss_The_Lamb_ingame.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/e/e9/Boss_The_Lamb_ingame.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821094223\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Lamb\" title=\"The Lamb\">The Lamb</a> for the first time.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-7\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Removed in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(except in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc nr indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_nr_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/04/Dlc_nr_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20241126195308\" /></span></span>  When Ministros are <a href=\"/wiki/Champion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Champion\">champions</a>, their red shots only deal half a heart of damage, but they still deal a full heart of contact damage.</li>\n<li>If Ministros aren't unlocked yet, they are replaced by &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hopper\" title=\"Hopper\"><img alt=\"Hopper\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Hopper.png\" data-image-key=\"Hopper.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/8/81/Hopper.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821090334\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hopper\" title=\"Hopper\">Hoppers</a>.</li>\n<li>&#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Monstro\" title=\"Monstro\"><img alt=\"Boss Monstro ingame\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Boss Monstro ingame.png\" data-image-key=\"Boss_Monstro_ingame.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/5/50/Boss_Monstro_ingame.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210822103512\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Monstro\" title=\"Monstro\">Monstro</a> is the boss version of Ministros.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The name 'Ministro' is both a portmanteau of 'mini' and 'Monstro' and the Italian/spanish/portuguese word for 'minister'.</li>\n<li>Older version of this mob didn't have a jumping animation and was just crawling instead.</li></ul>\n<p><br class=\"content-filter-end\" /></p><div class=\"nav-start\" style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n<table class=\"nav-box nav-main\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"nav-title\"><span class